# Normalise text to LF in the repository. Working-copy endings still follow the
# platform, so this only keeps the stored form consistent across contributors.
* text=auto

# Test fixtures are byte-exact captures from real save editors. Tests assert their
# exact bytes - including CRLF counts, since NMSE writes CRLF on Windows and this
# project deliberately emits LF. Line-ending normalisation would silently rewrite
# them and break those tests on any platform whose checkout differs from Windows.
tests/fixtures/** -text
